            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ditto on this request. What I typically find myself doing is overriding the injected property as data in order to provide a default:\r\n\r\n```js\r\ninject: [\r\n  'foo'\r\n],\r\ndata () {\r\n  return {\r\n    foo: this.foo || 'default'\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```",
