            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I'm also +1 for this feature. Currently I have components that are nested within each other and parents provide info to the children. The warning always pops up for the root component as it doesn't have a provider for the injected property.\r\n\r\nSpecific use case: nested layout splitters.",
